message: "Please cite the archived software release when using this code."
type: software
title: "ADM1-TEA-LCA: Recorded Anaerobic Digestion, Techno-Economic and Environmental Analysis Workflow"
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Ugwiyeon
    affiliation: "Korea Gas Safety Corporation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/lyullee/adm1-tea-lca"
url: "https://github.com/lyullee/adm1-tea-lca"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A recorded research workflow preserving existing mass-based ADM1/R1-R4
  equation implementations and reconstructing their biomethane TEA/LCA,
  finite-grid optimization, robustness and sensitivity interfaces from
  historical research notes. Includes small executed examples and source
  hashes. It is a code record, not a claim of complete historical numerical
  reproduction, independent biological validation or a complete product LCA.
